    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="adressline">Miss Freda Kirchwey <lb/>The Nation
                        <lb/>20 Vesey Street <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New
                            York City</rs>
                    </fw><dateline><date when="1946-03-02">March 2, 1946</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3457" type="person">Freda
                            Kirchwey</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>Would you be able to have a personal conversation, even of only a few minutes,
                    with my former pupil of <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__143" type="place">Frankfurt
                        a/M</rs> wo would like to have some connection with the NATION. I know that
                    your time is very limited but perhaps you can give him a quarter of an hour.</p>
                <p>He is a very gifted writer and knows a lot about film. I am convinced that you
                    will be interested in him. I am enclosing a short biography of <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__1511" type="person">Dr. Plant</rs>.<note type="ea"
                        >Liegt nicht vor.</note></p>
                <closer><salute>Cordially yours,</salute><signed>
                        <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Prof. Paul Tillich
                        </rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
